            <div class="alert alert-info mt-4">
                <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">Summary</h2>

                <p class="mb-0">
                    The <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> element creates a dropdown,
                    while <code>&lt;option&gt;</code> defines each choice.
                    The <code>value</code> attribute controls the submitted value,
                    while <code>selected</code>, <code>disabled</code>,
                    <code>required</code>, <code>multiple</code>, and
                    <code>size</code> provide additional control. The
                    <code>&lt;optgroup&gt;</code> element can organize related
                    options into categories.
                </p>
